---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Guides & Reference | Sovrin Group" section="resources">
  <div class="dark-zone page-dark">
  <section class="hero-page">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker">Resources · Guides &amp; Reference</p>
      <h1>Guides &amp; Reference</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Sovrin Group's guides and references provide clear, accessible
        explanations of the concepts that shape our work. These materials help
        readers understand the terminology, structures, and principles that
        appear across Sovrin's unified architecture.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="card-grid">
        <a class="card" href="/resources/guides/glossaries/">
          <h3>Glossaries</h3>
          <p>
            Concise definitions of key terms used throughout Sovrin's Identity
            and Governance frameworks.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/resources/guides/concept-guides/">
          <h3>Concept Guides</h3>
          <p>
            Short primers that introduce foundational ideas such as the identity
            invariant, continuity, and governed reasoning.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/resources/guides/reference-sheets/">
          <h3>Reference Sheets</h3>
          <p>
            Lightweight summaries that outline core structures, relationships,
            and terminology.
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="section-lede" style="margin-top: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
        Each guide is designed to make Sovrin's conceptual landscape easier to
        navigate while preserving the clarity and precision of the underlying
        architecture.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/resources/">Back to Resources</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  </div>
</Base>
